        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"586021eb-7380-49e7-92df-4175134296b0\",\"review_text\":\"I hate appilication for pakistan\"},{\"review_id\":\"2a521212-8f44-467c-bb6f-8751d1bf6f53\",\"review_text\":\"niche aap for songs 🙂\"},{\"review_id\":\"42c6e11e-c7d1-4b5f-8e6b-36254aed278a\",\"review_text\":\"Nice app but now there are too much adds\"},{\"review_id\":\"5a7a0f95-dcf9-4e31-8c14-809c9b0d5e33\",\"review_text\":\"I've binnusing spotify since 2014 and I love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"1da9a081-e612-4330-a22a-3c0dc0f65a52\",\"review_text\":\"I don't get why I make a playlist it does not show up when I first open the app. I did not delete it. I have no idea what's going on.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3ec38288-cce3-45d1-8938-6e258bee8971\",\"review_text\":\"Most buggy piece of software I'm forced to use\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0f3b13c-1b19-47bf-a9bc-878c3d88b6a9\",\"review_text\":\"Perfecttt\"},{\"review_id\":\"4ff40938-6d7a-4f71-8c76-c3021e934858\",\"review_text\":\"I cannot stand how they are so pushy when it comes to payment. I have an automatic payment scheduled with them and have since 2015, but they continuously harass and bombard with \\\"reminders\\\" its honestly super annoying. I have never missed a payment, and won't ever....so I just don't understand the continuous \\\"reminders\\\" starting days before my actual payment day.\"},{\"review_id\":\"558f0188-3875-425d-9ac8-f16327a765e3\",\"review_text\":\"New user butt satisfaction\"},{\"review_id\":\"1a3ffd26-6046-4387-800a-74a918d73b7b\",\"review_text\":\"Greatest Music AAP\"}]}"
